<s2>
<ptxt>Resistance Inspection</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between each terminal of the steering pad switch assembly connector when the audio switches are operated.</ptxt>
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09083-00170</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table pgwide="1">
<tgroup cols="3">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="2.36in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="2.36in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="2.36in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Symbol)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A10(AU1) - A8(EAU)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>No switch pushed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>95 to 105 kΩ</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A10(AU1) - A8(EAU)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>SEEK+ switch pushed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 2.5 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A10(AU1) - A8(EAU)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>SEEK- switch pushed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>313 to 345 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A10(AU1) - A8(EAU)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>VOL+ switch pushed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>950 to 1050 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A10(AU1) - A8(EAU)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>VOL- switch pushed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>2955 to 3265 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A9(AU2) - A8(EAU)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>No switch pushed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>95 to 105 kΩ</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A9(AU2) - A8(EAU)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>MODE switch pushed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Below 2.5 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A9(AU2) - A8(EAU)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>On-hook switch pushed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>313 to 345 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A9(AU2) - A8(EAU)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>Off-hook switch pushed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>950 to 1050 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>A9(AU2) - A8(EAU)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>VOICE switch pushed</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle" align="center">
<ptxt>2955 to 3265 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</s3>
</s2>
<s2>
<ptxt>Illumination Inspection (Night Illumination)</ptxt>
<s3>
<ptxt>When battery positive (+) is connected to terminal A5 (IL+2) and battery negative (-) is connected to terminal A8 (EAU), check that the illumination (LED) in the steering pad switch assembly comes on.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>Illuminated</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</s3>
</s2>
</content1>
